@startuml
title APT-SD-D08 Fiscal Issuance Failure / Pending Exit Handling Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:Central PMS payment finality recorded;
:Central PMS requests fiscal issuance from Site POS Server;
if (Sales Invoice issued?) then (yes)
  :Central PMS records fiscal reference;
  :Central PMS evaluates ExitAuthorization;
  :APT displays fiscal complete and exit status;
else (failed / timeout / pending)
  :APT displays payment received but fiscal/exit pending;
  :Case enters fiscal exception workflow;
  :Operator Console or approved workflow reviews/escalates;
  if (fiscal recovery succeeds?) then (yes)
    :Central PMS records fiscal reference;
    :Central PMS evaluates ExitAuthorization;
  else (manual release policy applies?)
    :Governed manual release handoff with incident/audit/reconciliation tags;
  endif
endif
stop

note right
Fiscal failure blocks normal ExitAuthorization.
Manual release is separate governance, not normal authorization.
end note
@enduml
